  abstract = {TC-SpGEMM studies high-performance sparse general matrix multiplication with Tensor Core acceleration. The work targets the gap between sparse matrix multiplication workloads and dense Tensor Core-friendly execution, aiming to improve sparse computation efficiency on modern GPUs through Tensor Core-aware sparse multiplication strategies.},
